    "author": "塞壬唱片",
    "content": "<p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"134e345ed289f862c9b70740b3c28eaa\" title=\"[标题]500x500 无人物.jpg\" alt=\"[标题]500x500 无人物.jpg\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20220704/134e345ed289f862c9b70740b3c28eaa.jpg\"/></div><p style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">生命跃动的规律，将铺陈于我胸襟。</span></span></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">振动与意识，魔法和奇迹。</span></span></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">One plus one, just me and you.</span></span></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:1em\"><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">万物的《Magic Theorem》。</span></span></p>",
    "date": "2022-07-05"
  }
